{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Plot Summary*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nular Island was once a land ruled by dragons, who protected humans, received tributes, and demanded belief in the supreme dragon deity, the <strong>Yuanhai Dragon Emperor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a century ago, a giant stone fell from the sky and destroyed the dragon civilization on Nular Island. The survivors were forced to relocate to the nearby Nulebi Island. During their journey, humans finally discovered that the Yuanhai Dragon Emperor was nothing more than a fabricated false god invented by the dragons, and the entire belief was part of an elaborate hoax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story, set in a distant land, has no direct connection to Hecate Fernando or her personal maid, Ayla.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nulebi Island is a recently developed tourist destination by the international consortium <strong>Fenrir</strong>. After working tirelessly as a formal paladin for a year, Hecate finally gets a well-deserved break. To enjoy a relaxing and pleasant time, Hecate and Ayla decide to embark on a fun-filled trip to Nulebi Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle Eastern swordsman Li Hua, the noble dragon girl Phyloa, unknown landscapes, and new encounters await them. However, the picturesque and idyllic Nulebi Island hides dark currents beneath its peaceful surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the journey of these two, the mistress and her maid, end in a perfect conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Trigger Mechanism*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing Chapter 10 of the main story, engage in a conversation with Ayla at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Character Introduction*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818700/extras/\u83f2\u841d\u4e9